// The Arts' moves (WP-054). Each Art in arts.ron plays one of these; the Toll's Choir variant is
// the second toll. Frame data is tuning unless the spec says otherwise (docs/game/04-arsenal-and-
// builds.md, "Arts"). A stance's guard and parry come from its Art (arts.ron), not from here.
// Schema: crates/content/src/moves.rs. Registry numbers: 20000-20014.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
[
  (
